 "reasons": [
  "N008, N009 raised to level 2: neither is about the body, so they should not sit under 'Your Body Might Need Some Love First'.",
  "N037 raised from 5 to 4: 448 words on gratitude without conditions deserve a ToC entry.",
  "N041-N042 (the vow) moved to the end of the Nurturer: it interrupted the spiritual run N035-N044 and works as the Nurturer's practical capstone.",
  "N050 moved to open the Guide section: it says when the Guide should come in, which the reader needs before the Guide techniques.",
  "N058-N061 moved under N053: they answer what happens after you 'wait and listen', and are not about two-handed journaling; N057 stays with journaling.",
  "N064 moved next to N054: both are about reading feelings and thoughts; it had split the hook sequence N062-N063-N065.",
  "N092 moved to the end of Altered States: 'Now, the beautiful stuff' lands after the cautions, and its laundry theme leads into the real-life part.",
  "N132 moved under Differentiation: it opens 'Differentiation is slow' and was stranded under conflict.",
  "N136-N140 (finding a therapist, AI) moved after Finding People: it is about finding support, and lets the part end on 'The Love Has to Move' instead of AI therapy.",
  "N126 moved to the end of Speaking Up: it broke the conflict sequence N125-N127-N129.",
  "N131 raised to level 3: a safety item should be listed, not hidden as a sub-sub-point of 'Other Folks Also Have Hooks'.",
  "N141 dropped, N142 and N143 made level 1, N144-N148 level 2: the conclusion and the appendix are different things and each gets its own top-level entry."
 ]
